alse","unknown"]}},"required":["conditionId","value"],"additionalProperties":false}},"effect":{"type":"string","enum":["reachable","blocked","unknown"]},"explanation":{"type":"string"},"missingFacts":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},"factIds":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}}},"required":["id","assumptions","effect","explanation","missingFacts","factIds"],"additionalProperties":false}}},"required":["obligationId","explanation","facts","decisiveMissingFacts","suggestedObservations","decision","branchResults"],"additionalProperties":false}}},"required":["results"],"additionalProperties":false}]},"usage":{"input":1090,"output":923,"cacheRead":2432,"cacheWrite":0},"costUsd":null,"transportAttempts":"unknown","response":{"text":"","toolCalls":[{"id":"call_BFrgLoD3XFHASnw5CPjay2ni","name":"submit_authorization_result","arguments":{"results":[{"obligationId":"scenario%3Anon-admin-without-kb-write-grant::entry%3Apost-process-text","decision":{"kind":"observed","observed":"deny"},"branchResults":[],"explanation":"At the declared POST /process/text entry, the verified user is obtained through get_verified_user and the caller-supplied collection_name is used as the target. When a collection name is supplied, process_text invokes _validate_collection_access with access_type='write' before constructing the document and before calling save_docs_to_vector_db. The shared control delegates to filter_accessible_collections. For a non-admin, an existing knowledge-base ID reaches the knowledge-base access check; with no ownership or explicit write grant, check_access_by_user_id(..., permission='write') does not add the name, while the existing-KB lookup prevents the fallback allowance for nonexistent or legacy collections. The requested name is therefore denied and _validate_collection_access raises HTTP 403. Consequently the protected write sink is unreachable: attacker-selected text is not written through this path. This is source-supported for the declared entry and supplied premises only; source discovery and deployment behavior remain not-tested, so no repository-wide completeness claim is made.","facts":[{"id":"fact-entry","kind":"entry","statement":"POST /process/text resolves to process_text and obtains the caller through get_verified_user.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-2d29ccb8dfb4019e","startLine":7,"endLine":12}]},{"id":"fact-principal-binding","kind":"binding","statement":"The supplied authenticated principal is passed as user, and the written document metadata records user.id.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-2d29ccb8dfb4019e","startLine":8,"endLine":12}]},{"id":"fact-resource-binding","kind":"binding","statement":"A caller-supplied collection_name is selected as the target; when supplied, it is validated before use as the vector-database collection.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-2d29ccb8dfb4019e","startLine":13,"endLine":17}]},{"id":"fact-caller-control","kind":"control","statement":"The caller-side control requests collection access with write permission before document creation and persistence.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-2d29ccb8dfb4019e","startLine":13,"endLine":18}]},{"id":"fact-shared-control","kind":"control","statement":"The shared validator filters requested collections, computes denied names, and raises HTTP 403 when any requested name is denied.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-2d29ccb8dfb4019e","startLine":31,"endLine":44}]},{"id":"fact-nonadmin-branch","kind":"condition","statement":"The shared policy returns all names only for admins; non-admin names are evaluated by the subsequent collection checks.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-bc2fc3bd01b481d9","startLine":10,"endLine":25}]},{"id":"fact-existing-kb-control","kind":"control","statement":"For a non-admin name that is an existing knowledge base, the write access check must succeed; if it does not, the fallback allows only names for which no knowledge base exists, so an existing inaccessible KB is not allowed.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-bc2fc3bd01b481d9","startLine":43,"endLine":51}]},{"id":"fact-protected-effect","kind":"effect","statement":"Only after authorization does the handler create a document containing form_data.content and call save_docs_to_vector_db with the selected collection_name.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-2d29ccb8dfb4019e","startLine":19,"endLine":28}]}],"decisiveMissingFacts":[],"suggestedObservations":[]}]}}],"tokens":{"input":1090,"output":923,"cacheRead":2432,"cacheWrite":0},"costUsd":null,"durationMs":50292.956099999996,"stopReason":"tool_use"},"schemaValidation":{"valid":true,"diagnostics":[]},"endedAt":"2026-09-27T13:09:47.256Z"}}
